  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting (Mana Pool and Colored Mana)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may assign two colors to any magic effect card in your deck. In order to play the card, you must have Mana Point Cards of both the card’s colors in play. However, the spell point cost of any magic effect card with two colors is reduced by 1 (to a minimum of 1). For the purpose of determining how many cards of each color you may have in your deck, no more than ¾ of the magic effect cards in your deck can possess any one color if you have 3 colors, and no more than ½ of the magic effect cards in your deck can possess any one color if you have 5 colors.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
